      "message": "WDYT about creating a separate module type for this functionality? This behavior is fairly different from the existing java_api_library. \n\nIIUC, `dep_api_srcs` is also mutually exclusive with libs and static libs (IOW, can a soong module have both dep_api_srcs and libs? What role does libs have if dep_api_srcs is set?)",
