      "writtenOn": "2023-03-28T02:18:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AFAIK, `--subtract-api` subtracts the passed api methods from the codebase, rather than extracting api methods to a file, as seen in this [test case](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:tools/metalava/src/test/java/com/android/tools/metalava/SubtractApiTest.kt;drc\u003db26cf7090d2f82d446869abd26cf87763bab204f;l\u003d25). So to utilize this, I believe that we would have to invoke metalava like below:\n```\n$ metalava --subtract-api [all api files in the api surface other than the one(s) we are interested] --source-files  [all api files in the api surface]\n```",
      "parentUuid": "bfb1b1a6_a370d2c2",
      "range": {
